      "definicion_pragmatica": "Adverbs of manner (adjective + -ly: slowly, beautifully) answer 'how?'. Degree adverbs (very, really, quite, extremely, slightly) answer 'how much?'. Probability adverbs (probably, definitely, perhaps) answer 'how sure?'. Irregulars: good → well, fast → fast, hard → hard.",
